WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.377
Watch and read: While at the market, Ama thinks about this: Which form has full stops

00:00:05.377 --> 00:00:06.024
after initials?

00:00:06.867 --> 00:00:11.069
The answer is: K. A. Mensah. Initials can be followed by full stops.

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:17.260
Watch and read: Kojo is learning with a partner at school. Which form has full stops

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:17.923
after initials?

00:00:18.783 --> 00:00:22.986
The answer is: K. A. Mensah. Initials can be followed by full stops.
